        sca_url_help: 'Examples: <code>https://github.com/lodash/lodash</code> · <code>https://gitlab.com/group/project/-/tree/main/sub</code> · <code>https://github.com/o/r/blob/main/Dockerfile</code>. Private repo: your browser login can\'t be used by this page (blocked by browser security policy), so paste a read-only token (GitHub: fine-grained "Contents: read", GitLab: <code>read_repository</code>). The token stays in page memory, is sent only to GitHub/GitLab, and is not stored.',
